{
  "dom_id": "step-e13999",
  "name": "Example: Solving a System of Equations by Eliminating the First Variable",
  "problem": "Find the solution $(x,y)$ to the following system of equations using the elimination method:\n\n$$\n\\{\\begin{aligned}2x+3y=8 \\\\ x-2y=-3\\end{aligned}\n$$",
  "worked_solution": "Notice that the coefficient of $x$ in the first equation is $2,$ while in the second equation it is $1.$\n\nIf we multiply the second equation by $-2,$ then the $x$-coefficient will become $-2,$ which will cancel with the coefficient of $2$ in the first equation.\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14195579/assets/578670dd09f9565cfd6bd2c5f4151b99dae8a537975e7025a795937efbef2127.svg)\n\nNow, when we add the two equations, the variable $x$ will be eliminated:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{aligned}\\cancel{2x}+3y & =8 \\\\ \\cancel{-2x}+4y & =6 \\\\ (3y+4y) & =(8+6) \\\\ 7y & =14 \\\\ y & =2\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, the solution must have $y = 2.$ However, we still need to find $x.$ To do this, we substitute $y = 2$ back into one of the equations. Let's choose the second equation:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{aligned}x-2y & =-3 \\\\ x-2(2) & =-3 \\\\ x-4 & =-3 \\\\ x & =1\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the solution to the system of equations is $x=1, \\,y=2,$ which can be expressed as $(1,2).$",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
  "fields": [],
  "problem_field_keys": [],
  "answer_fields_complete": null,
  "result": null,
  "proof_feedback": null,
  "html": "<div id=\"step-e13999\" class=\"step\" style=\"display: block;\">\n    \n                 \n                <div class=\"example\">\n                    <div class=\"stepHeader\">\n                        <div class=\"stepName\"><span class=\"stepType\">Example:</span> Solving a System of Equations by Eliminating the First Variable</div>       \n                        <div class=\"helpButton\" stepid=\"e13999\">?</div>\n                    </div>\n            \n                    <div class=\"exampleQuestion\">\n                        <style type=\"text/css\">\n                            .mjpage .MJX-monospace {\n                            font-family: monospace\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage .MJX-sans-serif {\n                            font-family: sans-serif\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage {\n                            display: inline;\n                            font-style: normal;\n                            font-weight: normal;\n                            line-height: normal;\n                            font-size: 100%;\n                            font-size-adjust: none;\n                            text-indent: 0;\n                            text-align: left;\n                            text-transform: none;\n                            letter-spacing: normal;\n                            word-spacing: normal;\n                            word-wrap: normal;\n                            white-space: nowrap;\n                            float: none;\n                            direction: ltr;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            max-height: none;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            min-height: 0;\n                            border: 0;\n                            padding: 0;\n                            margin: 0\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage * {\